				},
				{
					"id": 130280101,
					"content": "為了它們有機會能重逢，我很想再做點什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280102,
					"content": "除了這兩隻蕈獸，我也有點擔心浮游風蕈獸的營地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280103,
					"content": "嗯，我也有同感…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280104,
					"content": "我有個想法，要不要把它們送去，讓它們在一起生活呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280105,
					"content": "既然平日裡都有元素生物在引導，它們的生活習慣應該也比較接近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280106,
					"content": "對喔，互相也能有個照應！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280107,
					"content": "那你們願意跟我們走嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
