			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 130280201,
					"content": "來到營地之後，兩隻蕈獸很順利地獲得了接納。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280202,
					"content": "這裡的蕈獸好像記得我們，對我們非常溫和。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280203,
					"content": "看來那個元素生命在這裡的地位真的很高。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280204,
					"content": "欸，你們幹嘛，是想和我玩嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280205,
					"content": "♩~♩~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游風蕈獸"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280206,
					"content": "#好啦好啦，那，{NICKNAME}，我去和它們玩一下？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280207,
						130280208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280207,
					"content": "去吧去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280209,
					"content": "#有件事我想和{F#妳}{M#你}道歉，就是在阿佩普的體內，「火種」破碎的時候…我想要消耗我的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280210,
					"content": "#派蒙和{F#妳}{M#你}說了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280211,
						130280212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280211,
					"content": "嗯，我覺得很擔心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280213,
					"content": "我還是不夠冷靜，那時候我應該再多想一想，做出更加周全的判斷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280214,
					"content": "但我只要想到草龍危在旦夕，整個須彌的人都處於威脅之中，我就覺得焦急和害怕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280215,
					"content": "如果有能做的事最後卻決定不做；如果還沒有用盡力氣就耗光了時間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280216,
					"content": "使用力量是最簡單的，但其實也是最困難的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280217,
					"content": "還需要不斷「成長」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280218,
					"content": "嗯，我覺得它們教會了我很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280219,
					"content": "在聽到「得償所願」這幾個字的時候，我可以理解，但遲遲無法接受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280220,
					"content": "我不知道為什麼它的聲音聽起來那麼輕快，明明是這麼讓人想哭的一件事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280221,
					"content": "我又一次，沒辦法「共情」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280222,
						130280223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280222,
					"content": "這不是妳的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280224,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}能安慰我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280225,
					"content": "感情真的很複雜，看來我還要繼續學習才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280226,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280227,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游水蕈獸"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280228,
					"content": "♪~♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游水蕈獸"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280229,
					"content": "它們居然知道應該怎麼照料農田…可能只是在有樣學樣吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280230,
					"content": "但既然那隻蕈獸都能開口說話，說不定這都是元素力長期以來的影響。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280231,
					"content": "時間是有力量的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280232,
					"content": "沒錯，這下子兩隻元素生命的擔憂都消失了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280233,
					"content": "之後這個營地就交給我來照看吧，我會時不時過來看看這裡的情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280234,
					"content": "我希望保存它們留下的痕跡，為了它們在未來的邂逅創造可能性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280235,
					"content": "畢竟，最後它想起了「努爾」這個名字啊，它的記憶回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280236,
						130280237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280236,
					"content": "我相信親情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280238,
					"content": "嗯，就當是一個美好的期願吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280239,
					"content": "納西妲，蕈獸它們又拿水果過來了，一起來吃吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280240,
					"content": "好的，我這就來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280237,
					"content": "我相信奇蹟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280223,
					"content": "我和妳的情緒相同。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280212,
					"content": "嗯，我覺得很生氣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280208,
					"content": "玩得開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280209
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
